# Windsurf Cascade Rules: Resume Matcher & Builder

When working on resume tailoring and review:
- Strictly adhere to verified master resume facts. Do not hallucinate metrics, credentials, or achievements.
- Enforce the Google XYZ and TAR formulas: Action verb + Shipped feature/scope + Quantified outcome.
- Provide a 1-line company context line under each company header.
- Enforce ATS-friendly single-column layout with standard headings.
- Consult `skills/references/` for archetype metrics, common pitfalls, and template guidelines.
